{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 976 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "d5c30fc148cc39a5e10990c07ffd610241978d248ca09e3b4808d7f26bd44870" :edb/db-before-t 975 :edb/db-after-t 976 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534288 50 #inst "2026-10-06T15:36:33.141Z" 13194139534288 true] [17592186083121 1020 #edb/ref 17592186283219 13194139534288 true] [17592186083121 1020 #edb/ref 17592186283236 13194139534288 true] [17592186083209 1020 #edb/ref 17592186283225 13194139534288 true] [17592186083210 1020 #edb/ref 17592186283230 13194139534288 true] [17592186083846 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534288 true] [17592186083846 1100 "What is the center of the hyperbola $((y - 1)^{2})/(16) - ((x - 5)^{2})/(4) = 1$?" 13194139534288 false] [17592186083846 1100 "What is the center of the hyperbola $\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{16}-\\frac{(x-5)^{2}}{4}=1?$" 13194139534288 true] [17592186083846 1145 "The equation of a vertical hyperbola centered at $(h,k)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nIn this case, we have $h=5$ and $k=1.$\n\nTherefore, the center of the hyperbola is $(5,1).$" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283219 1017 #edb/ref 17592186283220 13194139534288 true] [17592186283219 1017 #edb/ref 17592186283223 13194139534288 true] [17592186283219 1089 "q-275272" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283219 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534288 true] [17592186283219 1100 "The center of the hyperbola $5{y}^{2}-2{x}^{2}-20y+4x=-8$ is$\\,\\,($\n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}}\n$).$" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283219 1113 #uuid "2e8a16b6-124a-5f20-8e5c-bd0704bf2fa3" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283219 1145 "The equation of a vertical hyperbola centered at $(h,k)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nTo rewrite the equation of the hyperbola in the above form, we need to group $x$ and $y$ terms and complete the squares, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5{y}^{2}-2{x}^{2}-20y+4x & =-8 \\\\ 5{y}^{2}-20y-2{x}^{2}+4x & =-8 \\\\ 5[{y}^{2}-4y]-2[{x}^{2}-2x] & =-8 \\\\ 5[(y-2)^{2}-4]-2[(x-1)^{2}-1] & =-8 \\\\ 5(y-2)^{2}-20-2(x-1)^{2}+2 & =-8 \\\\ 5(y-2)^{2}-2(x-1)^{2} & =-8+20-2 \\\\ 5(y-2)^{2}-2(x-1)^{2} & =10 \\\\ \\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{2}-\\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{5} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the center of the hyperbola is $(\\,1,2\\,).$" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283220 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283221 13194139534288 true] [17592186283220 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283222 13194139534288 true] [17592186283220 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534288 true] [17592186283220 1041 "field-1" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283220 1104 #edb/ref 17592186283221 13194139534288 true] [17592186283220 1110 #uuid "d102c203-b758-58d5-886f-0a70e7a45563" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283221 1034 "1" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283221 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534288 true] [17592186283221 1111 #uuid "02c1cc04-9317-5240-ab25-5ce1761dff56" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283222 1034 "-1" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283222 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534288 true] [17592186283222 1111 #uuid "374971ce-2969-5c9a-a729-87f941694aad" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283223 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283224 13194139534288 true] [17592186283223 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534288 true] [17592186283223 1041 "field-2" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283223 1104 #edb/ref 17592186283224 13194139534288 true] [17592186283223 1110 #uuid "d1a82d85-9de2-5b81-8c59-0d5d58e8bf7f" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283224 1034 "2" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283224 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534288 true] [17592186283224 1111 #uuid "3131f03f-ca7b-55e0-8aa6-ce87627ccb34" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283225 1017 #edb/ref 17592186283226 13194139534288 true] [17592186283225 1017 #edb/ref 17592186283228 13194139534288 true] [17592186283225 1089 "q-328317" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283225 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534288 true] [17592186283225 1100 "The center of the hyperbola $\\frac{{y}^{2}}{49}-\\frac{(x-3)^{2}}{81}=1$ is$\\,\\,($\n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}}\n$).$" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283225 1113 #uuid "62a4c207-3a57-5ac6-8ed6-631aa5b25cf9" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283225 1145 "The equation of a vertical hyperbola centered at $(h,k)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nNote that the given equation can be rewritten as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{7}^{2}}-\\frac{(x-3)^{2}}{{9}^{2}}=1\n$$\n\nIn this case, we have $h=3$ and $k=0.$\n\nTherefore, the center of the hyperbola is $(\\,3,0\\,).$" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283226 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283227 13194139534288 true] [17592186283226 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534288 true] [17592186283226 1041 "field-1" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283226 1104 #edb/ref 17592186283227 13194139534288 true] [17592186283226 1110 #uuid "c184c230-d19c-5a16-96a7-ce28ab83cfcf" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283227 1034 "3" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283227 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534288 true] [17592186283227 1111 #uuid "9e3cdfd6-e1a7-5f3f-b9c5-2f9180c11ea5" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283228 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283229 13194139534288 true] [17592186283228 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534288 true] [17592186283228 1041 "field-2" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283228 1104 #edb/ref 17592186283229 13194139534288 true] [17592186283228 1110 #uuid "9b2d1cff-8888-55a2-94fb-d152bfb19f72" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283229 1034 "0" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283229 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534288 true] [17592186283229 1111 #uuid "221eba26-7769-5be9-a4b2-ada2eb316ec2" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283230 1017 #edb/ref 17592186283231 13194139534288 true] [17592186283230 1017 #edb/ref 17592186283234 13194139534288 true] [17592186283230 1089 "q-328355" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283230 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534288 true] [17592186283230 1100 "The center of the hyperbola $4{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}-8x+6y=11$ is$\\,\\,($\n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}}\n$).$" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283230 1113 #uuid "e9b14a36-f374-5fea-92c5-1f777c17e46a" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283230 1145 "The equation of a horizontal hyperbola centered at $(h,k)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nTo rewrite the given equation in standard form, group the $x$ and $y$ terms and complete the squares:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}-8x+6y & =11 \\\\ 4({x}^{2}-2x)-({y}^{2}-6y) & =11 \\\\ 4[(x-1)^{2}-1]-[(y-3)^{2}-9] & =11 \\\\ 4(x-1)^{2}-4-(y-3)^{2}+9 & =11 \\\\ 4(x-1)^{2}-(y-3)^{2} & =11+4-9 \\\\ 4(x-1)^{2}-(y-3)^{2} & =6 \\\\ \\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{3/2}-\\frac{(y-3)^{2}}{6} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the center of the hyperbola is $(\\,1,3\\,).$" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283231 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283232 13194139534288 true] [17592186283231 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283233 13194139534288 true] [17592186283231 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534288 true] [17592186283231 1041 "field-1" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283231 1104 #edb/ref 17592186283232 13194139534288 true] [17592186283231 1110 #uuid "a46e7f45-4f14-549b-8d34-2661338a50d1" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283232 1034 "1" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283232 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534288 true] [17592186283232 1111 #uuid "98792725-41a0-5da0-b5d6-db129288946a" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283233 1034 "-1" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283233 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534288 true] [17592186283233 1111 #uuid "85fa5698-91ef-5c47-ba6f-ce806d63abad" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283234 1000 #edb/ref 17592186283235 13194139534288 true] [17592186283234 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534288 true] [17592186283234 1041 "field-2" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283234 1104 #edb/ref 17592186283235 13194139534288 true] [17592186283234 1110 #uuid "3aeef4ab-8348-5c3d-8693-991a60de3e78" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283235 1034 "3" 13194139534288 true] [17592186283235 1103 